{"id":"n53763-3-7","stage":5,"title":"떠돌다 · 传开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53763-3-7-1","ko":"삼 층 화장실에서 귀신이 나온다는 이야기 들었어?","zh":"你听说三楼的洗手间有鬼出现吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼","meaning":"三","explanation":"삼：三。","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61854","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}},{"text":"층","meaning":"层","explanation":"층：层。","readings":[{"term":"층","audio":"/audio/5987e716eafb9e902330.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20264","senseId":"4","lemma":"층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"층","audio":"/audio/5987e716eafb9e902330.mp3"}},{"text":"화장실에서","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화장실에서","audio":"/audio/d6aef0d14b2f32f1941c.mp3"}},{"text":"귀신이","meaning":"鬼，鬼魂","explanation":"귀신：鬼，鬼魂；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"귀신","audio":"/audio/b88f6786ac78a87de54c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36872","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀신이","audio":"/audio/88db2e8b1509b4ad83b5.mp3"}},{"text":"나온다는","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；ㄴ다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온다는","audio":"/audio/4f2a4eae791fb0820ad4.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61854","definition":"二加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"5987e716eafb9e90","term":"층","zh":"层","audio":"/audio/5987e716eafb9e902330.mp3","entryId":"20264","definition":"对建筑物中高度相同的部分从下往上计算次序时使用的单位。","pronunciation":["층"]},{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"b88f6786ac78a87d","term":"귀신","zh":"鬼，鬼魂","audio":"/audio/b88f6786ac78a87de54c.mp3","entryId":"36872","definition":"人死后留下的灵魂。","pronunciation":["귀ː신"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"说或写给别人的关于某个事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等的话或文章。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/27edf78c6114dfa1f8d2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53763-3-7-2","ko":"정말? 애들도 아니고 왜 그런 괴담이 떠도는지 모르겠네.","zh":"真的吗？又不是小孩子，真不明白为什么会有那种鬼故事流传啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"애들도","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들도","audio":"/audio/2a9e6f2415f0ecacb025.mp3"}},{"text":"아니고","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아니고","audio":"/audio/b24a9da411398b9f0ec2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니고","audio":"/audio/b24a9da411398b9f0ec2.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样。","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"괴담이","meaning":"怪谈","explanation":"괴담：怪谈；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"괴담","audio":"/audio/cc0a48ef3e8c50ffdad1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30847","senseId":"1","lemma":"괴담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괴담이","audio":"/audio/65f23c7979008f79a03f.mp3"}},{"text":"떠도는지","meaning":"传开","explanation":"떠돌다：传开；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"떠돌다","audio":"/audio/96dff2667c36a7a6ba21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53763","senseId":"3","lemma":"떠돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠도는지","audio":"/audio/70a0b7bb28a9ede24b00.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠네.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠네","audio":"/audio/cd769d647f197a315d70.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"cc0a48ef3e8c50ff","term":"괴담","zh":"怪谈","audio":"/audio/cc0a48ef3e8c50ffdad1.mp3","entryId":"30847","definition":"既恐怖又奇怪的故事。","pronunciation":["괴ː담","궤ː담"]},{"id":"96dff2667c36a7a6","term":"떠돌다","zh":"传开","audio":"/audio/96dff2667c36a7a6ba21.mp3","entryId":"53763","definition":"某种话或者消息广泛传播。","pronunciation":["떠돌다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac2ea155fdff7594f3b7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.217,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53763","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你听说三楼的洗手间有鬼出现吗？","真的吗？又不是小孩子，真不明白为什么会有那种鬼故事流传啊。","你最近在喝健康饮料啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你听说三楼的洗手间有鬼出现吗？","真的吗？又不是小孩子，真不明白为什么会有那种鬼故事流传啊。","你最近在喝健康饮料啊。"],